{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:102175","published":"2026-11-24T06:01:39.579265Z","modified":"2026-11-24T06:30:02.324745161Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-55888"],"summary":"Important: xdg-desktop-portal security update","details":"The xdg-desktop-portal packages provide a portal front-end service to flatpak. Thesis service exposes a series of D-Bus interfaces known as portals under a well-known name (org.freedesktop.portal.Desktop) and object path (/org/freedesktop/portal/desktop). The portal interfaces include APIs for file access, opening URIs, printing and others.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* xdg-desktop-portal: xdg-desktop-portal: Unauthorized host file access via unvalidated FileChooser filenames (CVE-2026-55888)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"xdg-desktop-portal","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/xdg-desktop-portal?distro=rocky-linux-8&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:1.12.6-3.el8_10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:102175.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xdg-desktop-portal-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/xdg-desktop-portal-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-8&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:1.12.6-3.el8_10"}],"database_specific":{"yum_repository":"AppStream"}}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://storage.googleapis.com/resf-osv-data/RLSA-2026:102175.json"}},{"package":{"name":"xdg-desktop-portal-debugsource","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/xdg-desktop-portal-debugsource?distro=rocky-linux-8&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:1.12.6-3.el8_10"}],"datab